OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLow cloud    
OL,6,Fand patchy rain linger through the     
OL,7,Fspine of Great Britain, with clear     
OL,8,Fspells in the northwest leading to an  
OL,9,Fearly overnight frost here. Heavy rain 
OL,10,Farrives in the south in the early      
OL,11,Fhours where it will feel milder.       
OL,13,CSaturday:FA wet day for most, with     
OL,14,Fbands of heavy rain sweeping up        
OL,15,Fthrough the UK, strong winds over high 
OL,16,Fground and near coasts, with gales in  
OL,17,Fthe northeast. Feeling milder.         
